+/* xb_p1s: `calls (a0)` from xb_grain (sp = its sp): V (64,sp), H (68), groups of 4 px (72), r (76, in and out).
+ * Per px: n = lo + hi nibble of a random byte, v = (V + n) >> 1 -> V, h = (v + v_left + 2) >> 2 -> H (v_left = 15
