+/* Soft Focus weight (getter 0x605048c1, entered `call ...,[],0`): MDR = return (0x60504edb combiner 11, stills;
+ * 0x60504f23 combiner 12), a0 = context, key 11 checked. d0 = w (Q10 weight of the sharp input); stock key 11: 600. */
